note Converted from the Lapis prototype, attic/lapis/registry.lp, whose only
note entry was
note   command to page (page) (moves to specified page)
note
note Shark builds this in, so the file now shows the two built-in ways to move
note between pages instead of declaring anything.

page Start
  show text Two ways to change page
  show button Continue to page Finish

page Finish
  show text You arrived by the button's own `to page` ending
  show button Back

  when Back is pressed
    open page Start
